@startuml j6-qr-and-statement
title J6 Customer page: UPI QR code and a printable statement
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam roundCorner 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam titleFontSize 17
skinparam titleFontColor #0E5C45
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #0E5C45
  LifeLineBorderColor #7FA89A
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #E8F2EE
  ParticipantBorderColor #0E5C45
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F2EE
  ParticipantFontColor #0B3D2E
  ActorBorderColor #0E5C45
  ActorBackgroundColor #E8F2EE
  ActorFontColor #0B3D2E
  GroupBorderColor #0E5C45
  GroupHeaderFontColor #0E5C45
  GroupBackgroundColor #F3F8F6
  DividerBorderColor #0E5C45
  DividerBackgroundColor #E8F2EE
  DividerFontColor #0B3D2E
  BoxBorderColor #0E5C45
}
skinparam database {
  BorderColor #0E5C45
  BackgroundColor #E8F2EE
}
skinparam note {
  BorderColor #B08A2E
  BackgroundColor #FFF8E6
  FontSize 12
}
actor "Shop owner" as Owner
participant "Browser UI\n(index.html)" as UI
participant "app.js" as App
participant "QR library on the site\n(vendor/qrcode.min.js, qrcode-generator 1.4.4)" as CDN
autonumber
Owner -> UI : tap a customer name (link #/c/{phone})
UI -> App : hashchange: route(), spy()
App -> App : currentPhone = phone; show #view-customer;\nmove the entry form into the page
App -> App : render(), renderCustomer(b)
App -> UI : name with local script, phone, balance, last paid, entries newest first\nwith the running balance after each
App -> UI : #cust-remind, #cust-upi and #cust-qr (the last two only when bal above zero)
note right of UI : v1.2 add-on profile.js, on each render:\na "Balance over time" line drawn as inline SVG,\none point per entry, with the highest and lowest balance
== UPI QR code ==
Owner -> UI : tap UPI QR code (#cust-qr)
UI -> App : showQr(): open #qr-card, show amount and UPI ID (demo note if not set)
App -> App : loadQr()
alt window.qrcode already loaded
  App -> App : use it
else first time
  App -> CDN : add script vendor/qrcode.min.js (from the site itself since v1.4.1; cdnjs before)
  CDN --> App : onload: window.qrcode
end
alt library ready
  App -> UI : #qr-box = qrSvg(upiLink(c, bal)) (SVG drawn in the page)
else script fails (offline or blocked)
  App -> UI : #qr-box shows the upi:~//pay link as text
  note right of App : qrLib reset, so the next tap tries again
end
note over Owner, UI : the customer scans the code on the owner's screen with any UPI app
Owner -> UI : tap UPI QR code again: showQr() closes the card
== Statement ==
Owner -> UI : tap Statement (PDF) (#cust-statement)
UI -> App : Promise.race(loadQr(), 1.5 s timer)
note right of App : waits at most 1.5 s for the QR library;\nthe statement prints either way
App -> App : printStatement()
App -> UI : #print-area: shop, customer, date (todayIso()), table oldest first\nwith gave, got and running balance, totals\n(v1.1: the shop logo, owner and address in the heading when a profile is set)
opt balance above zero and window.qrcode loaded
  App -> UI : add scan-to-pay QR with amount and UPI ID
end
App -> UI : document.title = "Statement - {name} - {shop}"; body.print-mode
App -> UI : after 50 ms: window.print()
UI --> Owner : browser print dialog: print or save as PDF
App -> UI : afterprint (or 1.5 s later): remove print-mode, restore the title
@enduml
